OL,3,GNEWSAStudent route from town to campus
OL,4,A'refreshed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA route to help students find the
OL,7,Fsafest and most well-lit route home to
OL,8,Ftheir campus has been refreshed, a
OL,9,Fcouncil has said.
OL,11,FThe Student Route, from the University
OL,12,Fof Northampton's Waterside Campus to
OL,13,Fthe town centre, has been in place for
OL,14,Fa number of years.
OL,16,FThe upgrade comes after students raised
OL,17,Fconcerns about safety in December due
OL,18,Fto a lack of lighting and visible
OL,19,Fsecurity cameras on the route.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
